{"title":"이 용사 실화냐","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bTjeYk/hAd4VbUSZU/SFAY8LnQbH8dKu04hqW1s1&filename=th3","synopsis":"지금까지 이런 용사는 없었다.\n이것은 용사인가 악마인가.\n\n같은 반 아이들과 이세계로 소환된 강한수.\n반 친구들은 마법이니 이세계니 신기해 하지만,\n한수는 얼른 집에 돌아가고 싶을 뿐이다.\n안락하고 따뜻한 우리 집을 냅두고 왜 이세계에서 모험같은 걸...?\n\n소환한 여신도 정 의지가 없다면 어쩔 수 없다며 본래 세계로 돌려보내주겠다고 약속하고\n한수를 집으로 보내주지만...\n\n눈을 떠보니 이세계 그대로!\n친구들은 없어졌고 주위에는 몬스터 뿐이다!!\n\n여신이 날 속였어...?\n집에는 어떻게 돌아가지...??\n그보다 여기서는 어떻게 살아남지...???","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":275,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":237,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":249,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":269,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":217,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":239,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":248,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":233,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":238,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":253,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":200,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":237,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":215,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":250,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":219,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":251,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":243,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":257,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":261,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date"